@startuml
title L2 - Lease 过期接管与旧 owner 隔离

participant WorkerA
participant WorkerB
database Repository as Repo
participant Downstream

WorkerA -> Repo : claim(version=0, owner=A)
Repo --> WorkerA : RUNNING, version=1, lease=t1
WorkerA -> Downstream : invoke(idempotencyKey, fencingToken=1)
note over WorkerA : timeout / pause / response lost

... lease t1 expires ...
WorkerB -> Repo : claim(version=1, owner=B)
Repo --> WorkerB : RUNNING, version=2, lease=t2
WorkerB -> Downstream : query or invoke safely
Downstream --> WorkerB : result
WorkerB -> Repo : transition(owner=B, version=2)
Repo --> WorkerB : updated

WorkerA -> Repo : transition(owner=A, version=1)
Repo --> WorkerA : 0 rows / stale owner

note bottom
CAS 防止旧 owner 覆盖任务状态，
但不能撤销已经发生的外部副作用。
end note
@enduml
